How This Simulator Works
This educational tool models the standard administrative pathway of a U.S. healthcare prior authorization request across three operational domains: the Patient, the Provider Clinic, and the Insurance Payer.
Advance the Case File: Progress the patient's active case folder through five sequential stages by dragging it to the highlighted drop zone or clicking "Process Step."
Resolve Clinical Challenges: At each stage, complete an interactive decision form—such as verifying active eligibility, matching chart notes to clinical criteria guidelines, assembling compliant document packets, or responding to payer audits.
Track Real-Time Performance:
Administrative Days Elapsed tracks the operational delays caused by your choices (optimal paths save time, while incomplete documentation or administrative errors add simulated delay penalties).
Process Efficiency Score rates your compliance with standard utilization management guidelines, deducting points for audit failures, unnecessary uploads, or bypassed protocols.
Achieve Determination: Successfully navigate pends, clinical denials, or appeal pathways in the final stage to secure the approval and review your performance summary.
